# PRD / TDD

A user-visible behavior change, an interaction-rule change, or a module, persistence, or bridge boundary change needs both of these in the same PR:

- `docs/prd/prd-YYYY-MM-DD-<topic>.md`
- `docs/tdd/tdd-YYYY-MM-DD-<topic>.md`

Put version, date, the paired path, predecessor, and successor in YAML frontmatter only. Paths are relative to `docs/`. When a new rule replaces an old one, mark the old clause with `后续修订` and a link, and update `docs/README.md`. Do not use `CHANGELOG.md` as a substitute.

Full rules are in `AGENTS.md` under Product docs.
